@startuml
actor Student
participant BookingService
participant BookingRepository

Student -> BookingService: request booking(roomId, start, end)
BookingService -> BookingService: validate time range (R1)
BookingService -> BookingService: validate room status (R3)
BookingService -> BookingRepository: check active booking overlap (R2)
BookingRepository --> BookingService: availability result

alt created
  BookingService -> BookingRepository: create and save booking
  BookingRepository --> BookingService: booking saved
  BookingService --> Student: confirmation (R4)
else unavailable
  BookingService --> Student: rejection (R1, R2 or R3 failed)
end

note right of BookingService
R1: future start; duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.
R3: blocked room cannot accept a new booking.
R2: no overlap with another active booking for the same room.
end note

@enduml
